{"summary":"A tactical spell-casting puzzle game","description":"Almost Out of Mana is a tactical puzzle game where magical spells, quirky enemies, and limited mana turn every decision into a meaningful choice. Strategically cast spells to defeat every enemy before your mana runs dry.\n\nWhy all this careful planning?\nA wizard is determined to retrieve his stolen lucky pants.\n\nWhat to expect?\n- Tactical spell-casting puzzle gameplay\n- Limited mana forces meaningful decisions.\n- Pure tactical gameplay without timers, no rush.\n- Distinct enemies with expressive reactions that change how you think.\n- A diverse spell-book with distinct mechanics\n- Carefully crafted levels of rising difficulty.\n- Relaxed pace, focused thinking.\n- Hints and game guide available if you get stuck\n- Clean, minimal art with bold, expressive enemies and soundtracks\n- Premium: no ads, no tracking, no distractions, no data collected.\n- Accessibility features including contrast mode, multiple language support, haptic feedback, and reduced motion\n\nI'm a solo game developer who made this game with lots of care and passion. I hope Almost Out of Mana brings you a little joy, a little challenge and plenty of fun!","esrbNotes":"Mild Fantasy Violence","pegiNotes":null,"iapPrices":null,"video":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/NvWeOkRp9Go?vq=large&rel=0&autohide=1&showinfo=0","header":"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/YBN8o3JKAmue9kAmb-FEgi5JvnpuJ4CrUDKwMDYiMYPQPKJvB2ptI9pQfDp9r0zFY9337IYEpduzPo5EfqQ7EQ","screenshots":["https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/R1SyHPTJQSEL77cAWRtjPHt8a6utVN_IOZ-ZBvWlQRnEL7PcBGM4AYvZlyqB0hmUBo9CHC2Qz85_u4DvMgkzKQ","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/1GLiezDrJU0JufgBGsmXuIJhTE9nw4BDmZJeJ-Bxe7qob_szMJR0u7mOHXsvhjYddzwdSxOOcIJDA1tVp_Ghxw","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/cNdfoSHKDtmYST1R2vhZuqN-Yd24CZmjugPfz1uiCIWQ2GCaCtBF2tMRezSEGA24zNwQACi1jH6aZx41JOPxTgM","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/4w771oUPFTZka2h5Pj6EKBe_sOa3tdB6kVzXwE3usXBxfLqRRKm2cMw